"window.permission.body" = "Accessibility permission is required to identify which app each menu bar icon belongs to.\n\nIt is used only to read icon ownership so they can be hidden. Nothing is recorded and nothing is uploaded.\n\nTo enable: System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility, then add MenuBarKeeper with “+” and tick it.\nIf MenuBarKeeper is already listed, remove it with “−” and add it back, so a stale permission record cannot get in the way.\n\n⚠️ You must quit and reopen MenuBarKeeper afterwards — macOS reads this permission only when a process starts, so clicking Refresh here has no effect.";
